{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "a1b2c3d4-e5f6-7890-ab12-cd34ef567890",
    "name": "01-rate-limiting",
    "description": "Requests for the 01-rate-limiting Nginx lesson.\n\n## Burst test\nRun the \"Hit the rate limiter\" request via the **Collection Runner** with:\n- Iterations: 30\n- Delay: 0 ms\n\nNginx allows 10 req/s with a burst of 20. Around request 21 you will start seeing 429 responses. The test script logs `ALLOWED` or `RATE LIMITED` for each iteration so you can watch the limit kick in.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Single request (sanity check)",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/"
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('responds with 200', () => {",
              "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "response": []
    },
    {
      "name": "Hit the rate limiter",
      "request": {
        "method": "GET",
        "header": [],
        "url": "{{baseUrl}}/"
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "exec": [
              "const status = pm.response.code;",
              "const label = status === 429 ? 'RATE LIMITED' : 'ALLOWED';",
              "console.log(`Iteration ${pm.info.iteration + 1}: ${label} (HTTP ${status})`);",
              "",
              "pm.test(`${label}`, () => {",
              "    pm.expect(status).to.be.oneOf([200, 429]);",
              "});"
            ],
            "type": "text/javascript"
          }
        }
      ],
      "response": []
    }
  ],
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3019"
    }
  ]
}
